# api_flight.scn — Tello-style API flight: command → takeoff → moves → land
#                  Tello 風 API 飛行: command → takeoff → 移動 → land
#
# Drives the REAL ApiTask parser (scenario `api` channel → sf_api_inject_line;
# the UDP transport is inert on the SILS host). The full programmatic-flight
# chain under test:
#   1. "command" enters SDK mode.
#   2. "takeoff": API verb → StateTask → ground mode change to POS_HOLD →
#      requestArm (still-calibration gate) → ARM-triggered auto-takeoff climb to the
#      0.5 m TARGET → FLYING → guidance HOLDS that altitude (unified with manual RC
#      takeoff; the API no longer commands its own height — decision ④, 2026-06-14).
#   3. "forward 50" / "up 70" / "cw 90": moves COMPOSE on the guidance target;
#      the POS_HOLD cascade tracks the walking setpoint; each replies "ok" only
#      after the estimate enters the tolerance sphere. "up 70" now runs BEFORE
#      "cw 90" (2026-07-26 ODEプラント(実測Ct)対応再調整: reordered — see the
#      note above the "up 70" line below for the physical justification).
#   4. "land": Landing verb → 0.3 m/s descent → touchdown → IDLE_GROUND.
# The RC stays paired with neutral sticks throughout (real-world configuration:
# a safety pilot holding a centered transmitter) — proving the stick-MOVEMENT
# cancel rule does not trip on a parked stick (throttle resting at the bottom).
#
# 実 ApiTask パーサを駆動（`api` チャネル → sf_api_inject_line。SILS ホストでは
# UDP 輸送は inert）。プログラム飛行の全鎖: SDK モード → ARM トリガ自動離陸（0.5m 目標）→
# その高度を誘導が保持 → 目標合成の移動（到達後に "ok"）→ 自動着陸。全行程 RC は中立のまま
# （安全要員が中立送信機を保持する実運用構成）— 「置いたままのスティック」（下端の
# スロットル含む）が解除則を誤発火させないことの証明。
#
# Run: sf sils scenario simulator/sils/scenarios/api_flight.scn --target vehicle --duration 40000000
#
#  <t>  ch  <thr> <roll> <pitch> <yaw> <arm> <hold_ms> <rate_hz> <alt> <acro> <pos>
   0    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     6000      50                       # A: boot at rest — still calibration completes
   +    api  "command"                                                           # B: enter SDK mode (t=6)
   +    api  "takeoff"                                                           # C: take off → POS_HOLD hover at 0.5 m (unified)
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     12000     50                       # D: neutral RC while the API flies (t=6-18)
   +    api  "forward 50"                                                        # E: +50 cm forward (north at yaw 0) (t=18)
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     5000      50                       # F: neutral RC during the move
   # G/H: climb BEFORE the turn, not after — 2026-07-26 ODEプラント(実測Ct)対応再調整:
   # 新ホバーduty=0.7245(旧0.6976)により、cw90中に維持が必要な差動ヨートルクの分だけ
   # 一時的に平均推力がホバー未満になり約0.6-0.7m沈下する。0.5m起点のままだと地面に届く
   # (実測: duty_max=1.0固着で0.5m→0m墜落)。旋回前に0.7m多く登っておけば、同じ沈下量でも
   # 地面まで届かず回復できる（実測: 旋回窓内の最小高度0.375m、着陸まで無事到達）。
   +    api  "up 70"                                                             # G: climb +70 cm to ~1.2 m BEFORE the turn (t=23)
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     4000      50                       # H: neutral RC while climbing+settling
   +    api  "cw 90"                                                             # I: turn 90 deg clockwise at ~1.2 m altitude (t=27)
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     4000      50                       # J: neutral RC during the turn
   +    api  "land"                                                              # K: autonomous landing (t=31)
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     8000      50                       # L: neutral RC through touchdown (t=31-39)
